{"3899460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CARGO: Co-Op Delivery Simulator in Post Apocalyptic World", "steam_appid": 3899460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the ashes of a broken world, you're the last link between survivors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the wheel in a post-apocalyptic delivery sim where every route is a risk, every upgrade is beneficial, and every delivery shapes your future. Drive solo or with friends in dangerous convoys, build up your home base, and fight your way through a wasteland shaped by scarcity, danger, and choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/5350d3fbde393950a5c43c0b71430a9d.poster.avif?t=1754564168\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/5350d3fbde393950a5c43c0b71430a9d.webm?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/5350d3fbde393950a5c43c0b71430a9d.mp4?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Off-Road Driving &amp; Terrain Challenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master realistic vehicle physics across hostile landscapes - cracked highways, deep mud, radiation zones, and sand-choked dunes. Upgrade traction, fuel systems, and cargo capacity to survive ever-tougher routes. Terrain is your enemy, and momentum is your best weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/530ddf20804f27e3987329ed071c310c.poster.avif?t=1754564168\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/530ddf20804f27e3987329ed071c310c.webm?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/530ddf20804f27e3987329ed071c310c.mp4?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-Op Collaboration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with other couriers. Share vehicles, split roles (driver, gunner, scout), or each take your own ride. Coordinate deliveries, defend each other during ambushes, and develop your settlement together. Whether you’re hauling cargo or holding the line, teamwork changes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/1cbf07fce1a3c6d31e67f95eda03315a.poster.avif?t=1754564168\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/1cbf07fce1a3c6d31e67f95eda03315a.webm?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/1cbf07fce1a3c6d31e67f95eda03315a.mp4?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounters &amp; Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warlord raiders stalk the roads, ready to rob you of the precious cargo intended for peaceful survivors. Fight by ramming, shooting, or simply escaping the chase. Scavenging abandoned ruins of civilization might attract them, but the reward is high - will you detour for loot or stick to the job? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/0b160ee509119963166e78f8651d1add.poster.avif?t=1754564168\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/0b160ee509119963166e78f8651d1add.webm?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/0b160ee509119963166e78f8651d1add.mp4?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Customization &amp; Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a garage. Grow it into a fortified settlement with facilities, production, and trade posts. Use delivery rewards to unlock new vehicles, gear, and missions. Customize your vehicle for combat, speed, size, or traversability. Shape the story of your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/34bb4dded32f9d3b4b0281ca838fbcfd.poster.avif?t=1754564168\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/34bb4dded32f9d3b4b0281ca838fbcfd.webm?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/34bb4dded32f9d3b4b0281ca838fbcfd.mp4?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the ashes of a broken world, you're the last link between survivors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the wheel in a post-apocalyptic delivery sim where every route is a risk, every upgrade is beneficial, and every delivery shapes your future. Drive solo or with friends in dangerous convoys, build up your home base, and fight your way through a wasteland shaped by scarcity, danger, and choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/5350d3fbde393950a5c43c0b71430a9d.poster.avif?t=1754564168\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/5350d3fbde393950a5c43c0b71430a9d.webm?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/5350d3fbde393950a5c43c0b71430a9d.mp4?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Off-Road Driving &amp; Terrain Challenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master realistic vehicle physics across hostile landscapes - cracked highways, deep mud, radiation zones, and sand-choked dunes. Upgrade traction, fuel systems, and cargo capacity to survive ever-tougher routes. Terrain is your enemy, and momentum is your best weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/530ddf20804f27e3987329ed071c310c.poster.avif?t=1754564168\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/530ddf20804f27e3987329ed071c310c.webm?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/530ddf20804f27e3987329ed071c310c.mp4?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-Op Collaboration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with other couriers. Share vehicles, split roles (driver, gunner, scout), or each take your own ride. Coordinate deliveries, defend each other during ambushes, and develop your settlement together. Whether you’re hauling cargo or holding the line, teamwork changes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/1cbf07fce1a3c6d31e67f95eda03315a.poster.avif?t=1754564168\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/1cbf07fce1a3c6d31e67f95eda03315a.webm?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/1cbf07fce1a3c6d31e67f95eda03315a.mp4?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounters &amp; Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warlord raiders stalk the roads, ready to rob you of the precious cargo intended for peaceful survivors. Fight by ramming, shooting, or simply escaping the chase. Scavenging abandoned ruins of civilization might attract them, but the reward is high - will you detour for loot or stick to the job? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/0b160ee509119963166e78f8651d1add.poster.avif?t=1754564168\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/0b160ee509119963166e78f8651d1add.webm?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/0b160ee509119963166e78f8651d1add.mp4?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Customization &amp; Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a garage. Grow it into a fortified settlement with facilities, production, and trade posts. Use delivery rewards to unlock new vehicles, gear, and missions. Customize your vehicle for combat, speed, size, or traversability. Shape the story of your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/34bb4dded32f9d3b4b0281ca838fbcfd.poster.avif?t=1754564168\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/34bb4dded32f9d3b4b0281ca838fbcfd.webm?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/extras/34bb4dded32f9d3b4b0281ca838fbcfd.mp4?t=1754564168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "The world as we know it has ended. In this post-apocalyptic offroad sim, you're the last lifeline between the scattered remains of civilization. Embark on deliveries, brave hostile terrain, fight raiders, and build your own settlement, solo or with friends in co-op. People of Wasteland need you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/546e2da34cbd6b2e8ff0bbe4123fa1642e13baea/header.jpg?t=1754564168", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/fd40f2d160646e36199ac8bd514121963fd5b6e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754564168", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899460/fd40f2d160646e36199ac8bd514121963fd5b6e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754564168", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64bit OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li